title: "HVTM CARE: AI-Driven Pharmaceutical Inventory Forecasting & Shortage Prediction System"
abstract: "A hybrid machine learning and deep recurrent neural network system (NeuroStack) engineered for multi-horizon pharmaceutical inventory forecasting, shortage prediction, and supply chain resilience under macroeconomic currency volatility. Developed as part of the 2nd Year Machine Learning Coursework in Software Engineering at the National Institute of Business Management (NIBM)."
